repository-code: "https://github.com/tonydzi/agent-sessions"
url: "https://github.com/tonydzi/agent-sessions"
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - agent transcripts
  - LLM agents
  - corpus
  - human-AI collaboration
abstract: >-
  An open corpus of full working sessions with a coding agent, published a week after
  the fact with personal data replaced by stable pseudonyms. Each file is one complete
  session: the request, the agent's reasoning, every tool call with its arguments, the
  false assertions and the corrections. Selection is automated and fail-closed: sessions
  that touch hiring, leads, investors or money are not published, and neither are
  sessions where technical work overlaps with those topics.
